## State Machine for Therapy Sessions

AuraEngine models journaling sessions as a Finite State Machine:

| State | Description | Next State |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `Idle` | System is waiting for the next scheduled cue. | `Prompting` |
| `Prompting` | Plays auditory tone and displays therapeutic prompt. | `Breathing` / `Recording` |
| `Breathing` | Guide user through paced breathing (ambient sounds). | `Recording` |
| `Recording` | Captures spoken journal response (encodes to Opus/AAC). | `Reflecting` |
| `Reflecting` | Prompts user to label emotions and self-assess mood. | `Saving` |
| `Saving` | Writes compressed audio and metadata locally. | `Idle` |

